  "explanation": {
    "en": "Range height = 100 pips. Target = 1.0900 + 100 = 1.1000. Risk 40 pips for 70 pips of target (about 1.75R). Breakout candle body was about 59 pips against roughly 25 pips for the candles inside the range.",
    "bn": "Range-এর উচ্চতা = 100 pip। Target = 1.0900 + 100 = 1.1000। ঝুঁকি 40 pip, target 70 pip দূরে (প্রায় 1.75R)। Break candle-এর body প্রায় 59 pip, range-এর ভিতরের candle প্রায় 25 pip।"
  },
  "keyTakeaways": [
    {
      "en": "A real breakout candle is much bigger than the candles inside the range",
      "bn": "সত্যিকারের breakout candle range-এর ভিতরের candle-এর চেয়ে অনেক বড়"
    },
    {
      "en": "Retest that holds the old top as support confirms it",
      "bn": "পুরনো top support হিসেবে টিকে গেলে breakout নিশ্চিত"
    }
  ],
